(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: MIC_1V8 for the faceplate microphone through a 100-200 mA switch (≤ 0.2 A ceiling).\n2. Absent state: MIC_EN low: MIC_1V8 off, discharged by 10 kΩ; PDM clock parked low.\n3. Open: the privacy-LED gate (BOM v1 line 35: DMG1012T, gate = MIC_1V8, LED anode from\n   FP_3V3) has no faceplate contact in pinout v1 §8.2; it is drawn when the LED's place is set." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 147.32 0) (size 129.54 13.97) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6b24eaba-7418-59f7-8c2d-b78d006520b2"))
